.
.  Generate sample output for F PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na fpdf4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 6
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 5
TIC LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE F PDF (1, 1 df)
PLOT FPDF(X,1,1) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
TITLE F PDF (1, 10 df)
PLOT FPDF(X,1,10) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
TITLE F PDF (10, 1 df)
PLOT FPDF(X,10,1) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
TITLE F PDF (10, 10 df)
PLOT FPDF(X,10,10) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp FPDF4.PS fpdf4.ps
system rm FPDF4.PS
.
quit
